WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.993
- Now I have to ask one
Ghostbuster question.

00:00:02.993 --> 00:00:05.010
(audience cheers)
- Right.

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.570
- Okay!

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:07.950
You guys, there's,

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.973
'cause I need to settle
whether or not this is true,

00:00:09.973 --> 00:00:12.751
there's a rumor that there could be

00:00:12.751 --> 00:00:15.373
(sing-song voice) a sequel coming.

00:00:15.373 --> 00:00:16.800
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.712
You know, there will be
another Ghostbusters.

00:00:18.712 --> 00:00:19.735
(host yells in delight)
(audience cheers)

00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:22.530
that I can definitely say, you know,

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.520
the last Ghostbusters was
very, thanks to all the fans.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.353
They loved it.

00:00:27.353 --> 00:00:29.369
And now we'll be making
another Ghostbusters.

00:00:29.369 --> 00:00:30.202
(audience cheers)

00:00:30.202 --> 00:00:31.214
- I love that.

00:00:31.214 --> 00:00:32.214
I love that.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.150
- And I'm happy to say that Winston,

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.370
the character I play is now a billionaire,

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.765
so he has a little bit more freedom.

00:00:39.765 --> 00:00:41.160
(audience cheers)

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.420
- Well, come on!

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.153
I might see you on set.

00:00:44.153 --> 00:00:45.070
All right.

